# 4. Difference Between AngularJS and Angular

| AngularJS                 | Angular                            |
| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Supports JavaScript only  | Supports JavaScript and TypeScript |
| MVC Architecture          | Component-Based Architecture       |
| No CLI Tool               | Has CLI Tool                       |
| No Dependency Injection   | Uses Dependency Injection          |
| No Mobile Browser Support | Supports Mobile Browsers           |
| Slower                    | Faster                             |

